    "熊地精愤怒地低吼着，显然很不满自己被一个突然闯入的访客如此痛打。"

translate schinese_rewrite battle_attack_script_b5fde2de:

    # "You can barely hear the groaning sound of the buggbear. He is in absolute distress, and ready to slaughter his attacker without mercy."
    "你几乎听不见熊地精的呻吟。他正承受着巨大的痛苦，随时准备毫不留情地将袭击者杀死。"

translate schinese_rewrite battle_attack_script_34af9287:

