translate schinese_rewrite battle_attack_script_8d723584:

    # v "Ouch, your fist does hurt. Wuldon's gonna have a hard time pissing you off, doesn't he?"
    v "哎哟，你这一拳可真疼。伍尔顿想把你惹火，恐怕没那么容易了，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite battle_attack_script_7d3cd5bc:

    # v "That was quite impressive for a non-werewolf. You do have some tricks up your sleeves."
    v "对一个非狼人来说，这一下相当厉害。看来你还藏着几手绝活。"

