    "你朝弥诺陶洛斯的手臂挥出拳头，刀刃擦过他的皮毛。"

translate schinese_rewrite mino_battle_loop_a03754cb_2:

    # "The minotaur stomps on the ground, clearly protesting against your attack."
    "弥诺陶洛斯用力跺地，显然是在抗议你的攻击。"

translate schinese_rewrite mino_battle_loop_be17f835:

    # "You punch into the minotaur's stomach, knocking him back a few steps."
    "你一拳打中弥诺陶洛斯的腹部，将他击退了几步。"

